  "bio": "Victoria Kurtz, a talented tattoo artist based in Louisville, United States, specializes in the illustrative and newschool styles. She practices her craft at Mama Tried Tattoos and impresses each client with her high skill level and creativity. Victoria's uniqueness also extends to her handmade jewelry line available at Crafty Kurtz.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Louisville, Kentucky, United States"
